			<br>
			<p> Wiglaf is a mobile general purpose platform that uses a bogey rocker system to move around. It is designed to test interfacing between
		       Grendel One and a mobile cybernetic device, and to provide Grendel with a mobile platform to explore the lab. </p>
			<br>
			<br>
			<p align="center">This series of pictures shows the design and build up of the main rocker arms.</p>
			<br>
			<img align="center" src="images/27972441_10100299804840782_1206315485616416435_n" >
			<br>
			<br>
